// Google Maps key for the iOS build.
//
// COPY THIS FILE to Maps.xcconfig in the same folder and put the real key in.
// Maps.xcconfig itself is git-ignored — the key must not be committed, unlike
// the web one, which is public by nature. See docs/maps-setup.md.
//
// An absent Maps.xcconfig is fine: Debug/Release include it optionally, the
// build still succeeds, and the map comes up grey while everything else works.

MAPS_API_KEY = PUT_THE_IOS_MAPS_KEY_HERE
